{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"Trae-AI/TRAE","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1872","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1872/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1872/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1872/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1872","id":3704142604,"node_id":"I_kwDONiYvnc7cyLsM","number":1872,"title":"Feature Request: 通用化接入兼容 OpenAI 协议的第三方模型服务","user":{"login":"tap6","id":23492851,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNDkyODUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23492851?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tap6","html_url":"https://github.com/tap6","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tap6/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tap6/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tap6/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tap6/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tap6/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tap6/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tap6/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tap6/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tap6/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":13,"created_at":"2025-12-07T23:44:02Z","updated_at":"2026-04-16T08:17:06Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"目前 Trae 已经能够很好地接入主流第三方服务商，这一点非常好。但在实际使用中，仍有不少中小型服务商（例如七牛云的 AI 推理接口：[七牛 AI Inference API](https://developer.qiniu.com/aitokenapi/12882/ai-inference-api)）尚无法被 Trae 直接支持。\n\n这些服务商的一个共同特点是：\n它们本身已经提供了 兼容 OpenAI API 或 Anthropic API 协议格式的接口。理论上具备被快速接入的基础条件，但如果每一家都通过“单独适配”的方式接入，无论是对 Trae 还是对社区来说，长期来看都会带来较高的人力维护成本，这在现实中也比较困难。\n\n基于此，我想提出一个能力层面的需求设想：\nTrae 是否可以像 Cursor 一样，支持通过配置可重定向的 OpenAI Base URL + API Key 的方式接入第三方兼容接口，从而让这些小众服务商“零或低成本”接入 Trae？\n\n不过在调研和实践中，我也发现这种方式目前在 Cursor 中存在一个明显问题：\n当我将 OpenAI 接口重定向到第三方之后，会 影响 Cursor 自家原本部署的 GPT 系列模型的正常使用。也就是说，当前的重定向方案是“全局替换”的，而我们的实际诉求是：\n\n使用自有模型时，走 第三方兼容接口；\n\n使用 官方模型时，仍然走 OpenAI / Anthropic 官方接口；\n\n两种模式应当能够 并存且互不影响。\n\n因此，综合来看，我更理想的诉求是：\n\nTrae 能否原生支持 小众第三方（兼容 OpenAI/Anthropic 协议）接口的统一接入机制，而不是逐一硬编码适配；\n\n若支持 “Base URL 重定向” 这种方案，是否可以做到 “按模型路由而不是全局替换”；\n\n如果未来还能提供一个 不会影响官方模型使用的“安全重定向方案”，类似于对 Cursor 当前机制的改良版本，那将会对开发者非常有价值。\n\n非常期待 Trae 在多模型、多服务商接入层面的进一步扩展能力，也愿意配合测试相关方案。谢谢维护者的工作与投入。","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1872/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1872/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},"comments":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3624153211","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1872#issuecomment-3624153211","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1872","id":3624153211,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc7YBDB7","user":{"login":"SuSuSoo","id":26691978,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NjkxOTc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26691978?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuSuSoo","html_url":"https://github.com/SuSuSoo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuSuSoo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuSuSoo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuSuSoo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuSuSoo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuSuSoo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuSuSoo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuSuSoo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuSuSoo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuSuSoo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-08T01:52:36Z","updated_at":"2025-12-08T01:52:36Z","body":"我完全赞同这位用户的提议，也非常有同感。作为一名Trae的用户，我也确实有类似的建议和需求。Trae已经能够很好地接入主流第三方服务商，这非常棒，但在实际使用中，我也遇到了许多中小型服务商无法直接支持的问题。甚至萌生开发第三方插件的想法(例如 参考 huggingface/huggingface-vscode-chat 或 musistudio/claude-code-router 的实现)， 但我始终认为来自官方的支持是早晚的事情, 所以一直在徘徊犹豫中等待。\n\n这些服务商本身已经提供了兼容OpenAI API或Anthropic API协议格式的接口，理论上具备被快速接入的基础条件。但如果每一家都通过“单独适配”的方式接入，无论是对于Trae还是对于社区来说，长期来看都会带来较高的人力维护成本，这在现实中也比较困难。\n\n因此，我非常支持这位用户提出的通过配置可重定向的OpenAI Base URL + API Key的方式接入第三方兼容接口的提议。这不仅能够有效降低人力维护成本，还能使得中小型服务商能够更便捷地接入Trae。同时，我也非常赞同“按模型路由而不是全局替换”的需求，这能够确保在使用自有模型时，依然能够通过第三方兼容接口，而在使用官方模型时，则仍然通过OpenAI/Anthropic官方接口，从而实现两种模式的共存且互不影响。\n\n对于“安全重定向方案”的提议，我也非常期待。如果能够实现一个不会影响官方模型使用的重定向方案，那将对开发者非常有帮助。\n\n最后期待Trae尽快在多模型、多服务商接入层面的进一步扩展能力！","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3624153211/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3626147677","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1872#issuecomment-3626147677","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1872","id":3626147677,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc7YIp9d","user":{"login":"Jessica-ppp","id":229125699,"node_id":"U_kgDODaguQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/229125699?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jessica-ppp","html_url":"https://github.com/Jessica-ppp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jessica-ppp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jessica-ppp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jessica-ppp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jessica-ppp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jessica-ppp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jessica-ppp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jessica-ppp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jessica-ppp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jessica-ppp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-08T10:23:42Z","updated_at":"2025-12-08T10:23:42Z","body":"理解的 我会反馈大家的建议给产品团队！\n","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3626147677/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3649446523","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1872#issuecomment-3649446523","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1872","id":3649446523,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc7ZhiJ7","user":{"login":"tap6","id":23492851,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNDkyODUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23492851?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tap6","html_url":"https://github.com/tap6","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tap6/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tap6/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tap6/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tap6/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tap6/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tap6/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tap6/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tap6/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tap6/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-13T13:44:02Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T13:44:02Z","body":"> 理解的 我会反馈大家的建议给产品团队！\n\nGLM4.6啥时候能接入？如果不能接入的话，接口更新了我们也能自己买智谱官网的用哇","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3649446523/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3650667410","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1872#issuecomment-3650667410","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1872","id":3650667410,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc7ZmMOS","user":{"login":"freekatz","id":47083415,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDgzNDE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47083415?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/freekatz","html_url":"https://github.com/freekatz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freekatz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freekatz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freekatz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freekatz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freekatz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freekatz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freekatz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freekatz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freekatz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-14T10:22:20Z","updated_at":"2025-12-14T10:24:00Z","body":"很可惜，支持base url这个小功能大概率是不会被开放的，影响长期商业模式发展，从目前 ide 中的限制逻辑就能看出有一些苗条。\n我提供一个可能能够破解的思路：\n1. 在自行添加 model 后，model 的信息会保存在 state.vscdb 下，以mac的国际版为例，在`~/Library/Application Support/Trae/User/globalStorage/state.vscdb`。\n2. sqlite 打开后，模型列表配置放在`{userid}__AI.agent.model.model_list_map` 下面\n3. 可以看到配置的模型名称、显示名称、加密后的 ak 以及 base url，长这个样子(省略了一些)：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"openai//gpt-5.2\",\n  \"multimodal\": false,\n  \"is_default\": false,\n  \"custom_config\": \"\",\n  \"display_name\": \"gpt-5.2\",\n  \"prompt_max_tokens\": null,\n  \"model_type\": \"chat_model\",\n  \"client_connect\": true,\n  \"provider\": \"openai\",\n  \"ak\": \"DZq99ysx......8K\",\n  \"base_url\": \"https://api.openai.com/v1\",\n  \"custom_model_id\": 75788034,\n  \"tags\": null,\n  \"sk\": null,\n  \"auth_type\": 0,\n  \"region\": null\n}\n```\n4. 所以，可以先在 ide 设置中添加好模型，再手动修改 base url\n\n可是，在实际操作中遇到一些问题：\n1. ak 是怎么处理的不知道，可能是用钥匙串密码加密？？但是加密算法是什么，AES-256？\n2. ide 添加模型时，默认要做一次 check，所以添加时如果填的不是匹配的 ak 还会报错\n\n总之，感兴趣的可以自己试试。\n就我个人来说，我开了 claude max，并且把 openai、gemini、claude都用 crs 做了中转，这都是为了避免封号，这看起来是个小功能，但确实对于重度玩家来说是一个很强的劝退理由。我对 trae 提供的编程工作流很感兴趣，我也很愿意开通 pro 甚至更高的会员，但是很可惜据我的实践，基础模型的能力才决定了 vibe coding 的上限。如果模型上还没有到第一梯队，并且不能保证国内玩家用你们的 ide，由于不能切换 base url 导致封号，那就最好开放这个功能。\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3650667410/reactions","total_count":11,"+1":11,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3651696754","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1872#issuecomment-3651696754","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1872","id":3651696754,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc7ZqHhy","user":{"login":"SuSuSoo","id":26691978,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NjkxOTc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26691978?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuSuSoo","html_url":"https://github.com/SuSuSoo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuSuSoo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuSuSoo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuSuSoo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuSuSoo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuSuSoo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuSuSoo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuSuSoo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuSuSoo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuSuSoo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-14T17:15:54Z","updated_at":"2025-12-14T17:15:54Z","body":"> 很可惜，支持base url这个小功能大概率是不会被开放的，影响长期商业模式发展，从目前 ide 中的限制逻辑就能看出有一些苗条。 我提供一个可能能够破解的思路：\n> \n> 1. 在自行添加 model 后，model 的信息会保存在 state.vscdb 下，以mac的国际版为例，在`~/Library/Application Support/Trae/User/globalStorage/state.vscdb`。\n> 2. sqlite 打开后，模型列表配置放在`{userid}__AI.agent.model.model_list_map` 下面\n> 3. 可以看到配置的模型名称、显示名称、加密后的 ak 以及 base url，长这个样子(省略了一些)：\n> \n> {\n>   \"name\": \"openai//gpt-5.2\"，\n>   \"multimodal\": false，\n>   \"is_default\": false，\n>   \"custom_config\": \"\"，\n>   \"display_name\": \"gpt-5.2\"，\n>   \"prompt_max_tokens\": null，\n>   \"model_type\": \"chat_model\"，\n>   \"client_connect\": true，\n>   \"provider\": \"openai\"，\n>   \"ak\": \"DZq99ysx......8K\"，\n>   \"base_url\": \"https://api.openai.com/v1\"，\n>   \"custom_model_id\": 75788034，\n>   \"tags\": null，\n>   \"sk\": null，\n>   \"auth_type\": 0，\n>   \"region\": null\n> }\n> 4. 所以，可以先在 ide 设置中添加好模型，再手动修改 base url\n> \n> 可是，在实际操作中遇到一些问题：\n> \n> 1. ak 是怎么处理的不知道，可能是用钥匙串密码加密？？但是加密算法是什么，AES-256？\n> 2. ide 添加模型时，默认要做一次 check，所以添加时如果填的不是匹配的 ak 还会报错\n> \n> 总之，感兴趣的可以自己试试。 就我个人来说，我开了 claude max，并且把 openai、gemini、claude都用 crs 做了中转，这都是为了避免封号，这看起来是个小功能，但确实对于重度玩家来说是一个很强的劝退理由。我对 trae 提供的编程工作流很感兴趣，我也很愿意开通 pro 甚至更高的会员，但是很可惜据我的实践，基础模型的能力才决定了 vibe coding 的上限。如果模型上还没有到第一梯队，并且不能保证国内玩家用你们的 ide，由于不能切换 base url 导致封号，那就最好开放这个功能。\n\n我的观点：\n\n1. 作为用户，我希望 Trae 开放兼容的 base_url，让有相同需求的用户群能接入其他平台模型，降低成本并提高选择自由。  \n\n2. 我反对本地 hack/逆向（比如改 state.vscdb、暴力改密钥等），那种做法有安全和升级维护风险，也不道德 （你有权选择其他支持 base_url 的同类产品，但不要公开讨论hack/逆向的技术细节）\n\n3. 给 Trae 的建议, 为什么这很重要：\n   - 竞争层面，同类产品已支持，如果 Trae 长期封闭会流失追求更强/更便宜模型的用户\n   - 生态和成本，开放兼容能降低小厂接入门槛，丰富模型生态，用户受益\n   - 用户留存，更多可选模型和更低成本会提高长期粘性\n   - 可控开放更稳妥，按模型粒度或作为高级计划/开发者功能开放，能在保护商业与风控的同时满足用户需求\n\n无论 Trae 最终是否选择开放，这都是他们的商业决策，市场是双向的，如何吸引并留住更多用户是 Trae 需要主动考虑的问题。","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3651696754/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3653541286","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1872#issuecomment-3653541286","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1872","id":3653541286,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc7ZxJ2m","user":{"login":"freekatz","id":47083415,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDgzNDE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47083415?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/freekatz","html_url":"https://github.com/freekatz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freekatz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freekatz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freekatz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freekatz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freekatz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freekatz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freekatz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freekatz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.c