逆向的技术细节）\n> \n> 这是 github，不是 gitee。你反对我支持，但是没必要扣什么不道德的帽子，Thank😙\n\n在 GitHub 上不用講道德嗎？那也太好了吧 😆\n那我也有話想跟你說欸 @freekatz \n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fbf09cb5-ff6a-4f5a-968e-9c26cd375192\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3654427045/reactions","total_count":24,"+1":0,"-1":24,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3668061156","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1872#issuecomment-3668061156","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1872","id":3668061156,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc7aoivk","user":{"login":"freekatz","id":47083415,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDgzNDE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47083415?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/freekatz","html_url":"https://github.com/freekatz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freekatz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freekatz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freekatz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freekatz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freekatz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freekatz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freekatz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freekatz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/freekatz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-18T02:50:10Z","updated_at":"2025-12-18T02:51:06Z","body":"\n> \n> 在 GitHub 上不用講道德嗎？那也太好了吧 😆 那我也有話想跟你說欸 [@freekatz](https://github.com/freekatz)\n> \n>  Thank.mp4\n\n1. 先说前提，这个建议是“不讲道德”？请你给个标准的定义，谢谢。\n2. 有什么直接邮件我，或者你能找到其他方式也可以，静候佳音，别光在网上撒泼。\n3. 能发出这种视频，真正没道德的是您吧？嗯哼？\n","auth